<title>GERMANY: WVZ details fifth German sugar beet test data.</title>
<headline>WVZ details fifth German sugar beet test data.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sugar industry association WVZ on Monday supplied the following details of the fifth German sugar beet test of the 1996/97 campaign.</p>
<p>			5th test 1996   4th test 1996   5th test 1995</p>
<p>Sugar yield per ha     11.10 t	 9.71 t	  10.08 t</p>
<p>Sugar content (pct)    17.8 pct	16.8 pct	16.4 pct</p>
<p>Sugar weight per beet  130.6 grams   114.1 grams   129.6 grams</p>
<p>Avg beet weight	  732 grams     680 grams     792 grams</p>
<p>Avg no of beets/ha     85,000	  85,100	  77,800</p>
<p>Avg leaf weight	  613 grams     634 grams     475 grams</p>
<p>Rain in past 2 weeks   19 mm	   20 mm	   33 mm</p>
<p>Beet weight/ha	   62.2 t	  57.9 t	  61.6 t</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
